      "entries": [
        "A shanrigol behemoth's attacks brutally rend its foes. Creatures critically hit by the shanrigol's fleshy slap Strike take an additional 2d6 persistent bleed damage and are enfeebled|CRB|enfeebled 1 for as long as they are bleeding."
